Z||000007||Oreif||08-22-2000||10:29 AM||||See Haze's post in the mall. I got the emblem from him. I just trimmed/cut it to make it fit. Haze has a variety of colors to choose from too. I just removed the "Holley" and glued the emblem on. I then taped the face up in order to give it a shot of clear coat. I did this because the original enblem is glossy and I wanted the whole area to match.<BR>I'd buy some Holley scoops to mod a few but I can't afford the $100.00 or more for the holley scoops on Ebay!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 08-22-2000).]||||reg||1
